  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA printed metrics were roughly flat this week:</strong> Distributed Value near $15.92B (-1.5% 30D) keeps on-chain RWA exposure in a holding pattern\u2014tokenization momentum is still news- and pipeline-driven until distributed value breaks range. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/vara-securitize-mou-tokenization-dubai?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">VARA, Securitize sign MoU for tokenization innovation in Dubai</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/ondo-urges-sec-cftc-bring-us-stock-perpetuals-onshore?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ondo urges SEC, CFTC to bring US stock perpetuals onshore</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Tokenized T-bill supply is still expanding through new products:</strong> That usually shows up first as new issuer and product supply, then as higher distributed value and denser collateral-style use across networks and platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/09/03/u-s-banking-agency-gives-blockchain-bank-openreserve-initial-ok-to-operate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">U.S. banking agency gives blockchain bank OpenReserve initial OK to operate</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/09/03/australia-is-cracking-down-on-crypto-businesses-as-its-strict-new-regulatory-deadline-nears\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Australia is cracking down on crypto businesses as its strict new regulatory deadline nears</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
